# map 48, two human sides: the joysticks as the sides' directions and
# buttons (joy_setup, joy_read, the sticks' part of input_side0/1), with
# m48_joy.joy beside it.  Both sides' sticks are wanted from the start
# (DATA:03B8, 03BA) and none is there.  F5 twice (off, on): each press
# looks for the sticks, so the first side's is found and used; F6 twice
# the same for the second's; a key while the stick rests; both off; then
# on again with the first stick gone and the second measured away from
# its middle; see port/README.md
32.00 f5
34.00 f5
44.50 f6
45.50 f6
49.00 right
52.00 f5
55.00 f6
57.00 f5
59.00 f6
